{"schema_version":"talkami_new_spoken_topic_v3_frequency_sorted","status":"draft_pending_native_review","theme_id":"02.03","theme_title":"约时间见面","theme_title_my":"အချိန်ချိန်းပြီး တွေ့ဆုံခြင်း","locale_pair":"zh-CN/my","updated_at":"2026-11-11","phrase_count":113,"original_count":75,"added_count":49,"note":"Utility-prioritized Chinese learner phrases, unneeded/duplicative expressions removed. New IDs and audio indexes synchronized; Burmese final review not completed.","scenes":[{"id":"02.03.01","title":"邀请并商量时间","title_my":"ဖိတ်ခေါ်ခြင်းနှင့် အချိန်ညှိခြင်း","original_count":22,"added_count":15,"phrase_count":34,"phrases":[{"id":"02.03.01-S001","text":"周末有空吗？","meaning_my":"ပိတ်ရက် အားလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S001_reply01","text":"有，周六下午有空。","meaning_my":"အားတယ်၊ စနေနေ့ နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်း အားတယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S005_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S005","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S002","text":"你什么时候有空？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်အချိန် အားလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S002_reply01","text":"我周五晚上有空。","meaning_my":"သောကြာည အားတယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S006_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S006","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S003","text":"你哪天休息？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်နေ့ နားရလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S003_reply01","text":"这周日休息。","meaning_my":"ဒီအပတ် တနင်္ဂနွေနေ့ နားရတယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S007_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S007","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S004","text":"周五行吗？","meaning_my":"သောကြာနေ့ ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S004_reply01","text":"可以，下午三点吧。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်း သုံးနာရီပဲနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S008_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S004_alt01","text":"星期五可以吗？","meaning_my":"သောကြာနေ့ ရမလား။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S008_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S008","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S005","text":"那就周五吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို သောကြာနေ့ပဲနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S009","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S006","text":"明天下午怎么样？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်းဆိုရော။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S006_reply01","text":"下午可以，三点怎么样？","meaning_my":"နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်း ရတယ်၊ သုံးနာရီဆိုရော။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S011_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S006_alt01","text":"明天下午有时间吗？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်း အချိန်ရလား။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S011_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S011","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S007","text":"我下午比较方便。","meaning_my":"နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်းက ပိုအားတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S012","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S008","text":"好啊。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းတာပေါ့။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S014","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S009","text":"今天不行。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့တော့ မရဘူး။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S009_reply01","text":"好，那改天吧。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဒါဆို နောက်နေ့မှပဲနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S015_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S015","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S010","text":"我晚上有空。","meaning_my":"ညဘက် အားတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S016","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S011","text":"时间你定吧。","meaning_my":"အချိန်ကို ခင်ဗျားပဲ ရွေးလိုက်ပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S011_reply01","text":"那就周六三点吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို စနေနေ့ သုံးနာရီပဲနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S019_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S011_alt01","text":"你来定时间吧。","meaning_my":"အချိန်ကို ခင်ဗျားပဲ သတ်မှတ်လိုက်ပါ။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S019_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S019","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.01-S012","text":"有空一起吃饭吗？","meaning_my":"အားရင် အတူတူ ထမင်းစားကြမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S012_reply01","text":"好啊，什么时候？","meaning_my":"ကောင်းတာပေါ့၊ ဘယ်တော့လဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S001_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S012_alt01","text":"有空一起吃个饭？","meaning_my":"အားရင် အတူတူ ထမင်းစားကြမလား။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S001_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“一起吃饭”是约一起用餐，不一定表示发起邀请的人会付钱；“我请客”才明确说自己请。","text_my":"“一起吃饭” က အတူစားဖို့ ချိန်းတာပါ။ ဖိတ်သူက ပိုက်ဆံရှင်းမယ်လို့ မဆိုလိုဘူး။ “我请客” ဆိုရင် ကိုယ်ရှင်းပေးမယ်ဆိုတဲ့ သဘောပါ။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.01-S001","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S013","text":"这周有点忙，下周吧。","meaning_my":"ဒီအပတ် နည်းနည်း အလုပ်များလို့ နောက်အပတ်မှနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S002","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S014","text":"要不要一起逛街？","meaning_my":"အတူတူ ဈေးလျှောက်ကြမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S014_reply01","text":"好啊，去哪儿逛？","meaning_my":"ကောင်းတာပေါ့၊ ဘယ်မှာ လျှောက်ကြမလဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S003_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S003","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S015","text":"我还有事，改天吧。","meaning_my":"တခြားကိစ္စရှိသေးလို့ နောက်တစ်နေ့မှပေါ့။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S004","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S016","text":"一起喝杯咖啡？","meaning_my":"ကော်ဖီအတူ သောက်ကြမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S016_reply01","text":"好啊，去哪家？","meaning_my":"ကောင်းတာပေါ့၊ ဘယ်ဆိုင်လဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S010_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S016_alt01","text":"要不要一起喝杯咖啡？","meaning_my":"အတူတူ ကော်ဖီတစ်ခွက် သောက်ကြမလား။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S010_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S010","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S017","text":"要不改到晚上？","meaning_my":"ညဘက် ပြောင်းလိုက်မလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S017_reply01","text":"可以，晚上七点吧。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ည ခုနစ်နာရီပဲနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S013_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S017_alt01","text":"要不约到晚上？","meaning_my":"ညဘက် ပြောင်းချိန်းကြမလား။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S013_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S013","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S018","text":"周末得上班，走不开。","meaning_my":"ပိတ်ရက်လည်း အလုပ်ဆင်းရလို့ မအားဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S017","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S019","text":"三点我有事。","meaning_my":"သုံးနာရီမှာ ကိစ္စရှိတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S018","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S020","text":"中午还是晚上方便？","meaning_my":"နေ့လယ်လား၊ ညဘက်လား၊ ဘယ်အချိန် ပိုအားလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S020_reply01","text":"晚上更方便。","meaning_my":"ညဘက် ပိုအားတယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S020_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S020","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S021","text":"找个时间聚聚吧。","meaning_my":"တစ်နေ့နေ့ အချိန်ရှာပြီး တွေ့ကြရအောင်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S021_alt01","text":"改天找时间见见吧。","meaning_my":"နောက်နေ့ အချိန်ရှာပြီး တွေ့ကြမယ်နော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S021_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S021","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S022","text":"要不周六下午？","meaning_my":"စနေနေ့ နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်းဆိုရော။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S022_reply01","text":"可以，几点？","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဘယ်နှနာရီလဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S022_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S022","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S023","text":"想请你吃个饭。","meaning_my":"ထမင်းတစ်ခါလောက် ကျွေးချင်လို့ပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S023_reply01","text":"好啊，不过下次让我请。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းတာပေါ့၊ ဒါပေမဲ့ နောက်တစ်ခါ ကိုယ် ကျွေးမယ်နော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S023_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S023_alt01","text":"我想请你吃饭。","meaning_my":"ထမင်းကျွေးချင်လို့ပါ။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S023_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“请你吃饭”通常表示说话人做东、请对方吃饭，与单纯“一起吃饭”有区别。","text_my":"“请你吃饭” က များသောအားဖြင့် ကိုယ်က ဝယ်ကျွေးမယ်လို့ ပြောတာပါ။ “အတူစားကြမယ်” နဲ့ မတူဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.01-S023","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S024","text":"这次我请客。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ခါ ကိုယ်ပဲ ဝယ်ကျွေးမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S024_reply01","text":"那谢谢你啦。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ကျေးဇူးပါနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S024_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S024","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S025","text":"想吃什么？","meaning_my":"ဘာစားချင်လဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S025_reply01","text":"吃火锅吧。","meaning_my":"ဟော့ပေါ့ စားကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S025_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S025","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S026","text":"你定就行。","meaning_my":"ခင်ဗျားပဲ ဆုံးဖြတ်လိုက်ပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S026","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S027","text":"要不要叫上别人？","meaning_my":"တခြားလူတွေပါ ခေါ်ကြမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S027_reply01","text":"就我们俩吧。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ယောက်တည်းပဲ သွားကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S027_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S027","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S028","text":"就我们俩吧。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ယောက်တည်းပဲ သွားကြရအောင်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S028_reply01","text":"好，就我们两个。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ နှစ်ယောက်တည်းပဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S028_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S028_alt01","text":"就咱俩吧。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ယောက်တည်းပဲ သွားကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S028_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S028","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S029","text":"那就说定了。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ဒီအတိုင်း သဘောတူလိုက်ပြီနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S029_alt01","text":"那就这么定了。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ဒီအတိုင်း သဘောတူလိုက်ပြီနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S029_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S029","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S030","text":"你能来吗？","meaning_my":"လာနိုင်မလား။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S032","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S031","text":"我尽量赶到。","meaning_my":"အမီရောက်အောင် ကြိုးစားမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S031_reply01","text":"好，路上别着急。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ လမ်းမှာ အလျင်မလိုနဲ့နော်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S033_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S033","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S032","text":"我们几点见？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်နှနာရီ တွေ့ကြမလဲ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S034","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S033","text":"能往后推半小时吗？","meaning_my":"နာရီဝက်လောက် နောက်ရွှေ့လို့ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.01-S033_reply01","text":"可以，往后推半小时吧。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ နာရီဝက် နောက်ရွှေ့လိုက်ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S035_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.01-S033_alt01","text":"能推迟三十分钟吗？","meaning_my":"မိနစ်သုံးဆယ် နောက်ရွှေ့လို့ရမလား။","previous_id":"02.03.01-S035_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“往后推半小时”是比原计划晚三十分钟；“提前半小时”是早三十分钟，方向相反。","text_my":"“往后推半小时” က အရင်ချိန်းထားတာထက် မိနစ်သုံးဆယ် နောက်ကျအောင် ပြောင်းတာပါ။ “提前半小时” က စောစောပြောင်းတာ။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.01-S035","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.01-S034","text":"你今晚方便吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီည အားလား။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.01-S037","priority":"situational"}]},{"id":"02.03.02","title":"约定地点","title_my":"တွေ့ဆုံမည့်နေရာ ချိန်းခြင်း","original_count":17,"added_count":11,"phrase_count":27,"phrases":[{"id":"02.03.02-S001","text":"咱们在哪儿见？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်မှာ တွေ့ကြမလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S001_reply01","text":"在地铁站A口见吧。","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာ A ထွက်ပေါက်မှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S017_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S001_alt01","text":"我们约在哪里见？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်မှာ တွေ့ဖို့ ချိန်းကြမလဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S017_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S017","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S002","text":"地铁站门口见吧。","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာ ရှေ့မှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S002_reply01","text":"好，哪个出口？","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဘယ်ထွက်ပေါက်လဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S001_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"地铁站通常可能有多个入口或出口，约人见面时说清楚“A口、B口”会更好找。","text_my":"မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာမှာ အဝင်အထွက်ပေါက် အများကြီးရှိနိုင်တယ်။ တွေ့ဖို့ချိန်းရင် A၊ B ဘယ်ပေါက်လဲ သေချာပြောရင် ရှာရလွယ်တယ်။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.02-S001","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S003","text":"我们在门口见吧。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝမှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S003_alt01","text":"门口碰面吧。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝမှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S004_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S004","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S004","text":"发个定位吧。","meaning_my":"တည်နေရာလေး ပို့ပေးပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S004_reply01","text":"好，马上发给你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ချက်ချင်း ပို့ပေးမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S002_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S004_alt01","text":"给我发下位置吧。","meaning_my":"တည်နေရာလေး ပို့ပေးပါ။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S002_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“发定位”通常是用地图或聊天软件发送位置，不只是发文字地址。","text_my":"“发定位” က မြေပုံ ဒါမှမဟုတ် ချတ်အက်ပ်ကနေ တည်နေရာကို ပို့တာပါ။ လိပ်စာစာသားပဲ ပို့တာမဟုတ်ဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.02-S002","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S005","text":"到了给我发消息。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ရင် စာပို့ပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S005","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S006","text":"哪个门比较好找？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်တံခါးက ရှာရလွယ်လဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S006_reply01","text":"A口比较好找。","meaning_my":"A ထွက်ပေါက်က ပိုရှာရလွယ်တယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S007_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S007","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S007","text":"我们在A口见。","meaning_my":"A ထွက်ပေါက်မှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S007_reply01","text":"好，我到A口等你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ A ထွက်ပေါက်မှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S009_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S007_alt01","text":"在A出口见。","meaning_my":"A ထွက်ပေါက်မှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S009_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“A口”是A字母标记的地铁出口，和“几号口”（数字出口）一样都用于定位。","text_my":"“A口” က A လို့ မှတ်သားထားတဲ့ ထွက်ပေါက်ပါ။ “几号口” ကတော့ ထွက်ပေါက်နံပါတ်ကို မေးတာ။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.02-S009","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S008","text":"从B口出来。","meaning_my":"B ထွက်ပေါက်က ထွက်လာပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S008_reply01","text":"好，我从B口出。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ B ထွက်ပေါက်က ထွက်လာမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S013_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S013","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S009","text":"在超市门口见吧。","meaning_my":"စူပါမားကတ် ဝင်ပေါက်ရှေ့မှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S019","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S010","text":"哪个出口离你近？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ထွက်ပေါက်က ခင်ဗျားနဲ့ ပိုနီးလဲ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S020","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S011","text":"几号出口？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်နံပါတ် ထွက်ပေါက်လဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S011_reply01","text":"三号出口。","meaning_my":"အမှတ်သုံး ထွက်ပေါက်ပါ။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S021_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S011_alt01","text":"几号口？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်နံပါတ် ထွက်ပေါက်လဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S021_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S021","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.02-S012","text":"等一下，我看一下定位。","meaning_my":"ခဏလေး၊ တည်နေရာ ကြည့်လိုက်ဦးမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S003","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S013","text":"可以，到了我给你打电话。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ရောက်ရင် ဖုန်းဆက်မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S006","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S014","text":"公司楼下见。","meaning_my":"ကုမ္ပဏီအောက်မှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S014_alt01","text":"在公司楼下碰面。","meaning_my":"ကုမ္ပဏီအောက်မှာ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S008_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S008","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S015","text":"我在楼下等你。","meaning_my":"အောက်ထပ်မှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S015_alt01","text":"我在楼下等着。","meaning_my":"အောက်ထပ်မှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S010_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S010","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S016","text":"就在地铁出口旁边。","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထားထွက်ပေါက် ဘေးနားတင်ပဲ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S011","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S017","text":"别走错门。","meaning_my":"တံခါး မှားမသွားနဲ့နော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S012","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S018","text":"你到了再联系我。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ရင် ဆက်သွယ်ပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S014","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S019","text":"我就在附近。","meaning_my":"အနီးနားမှာပဲ ရှိတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S016","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S020","text":"你定地点吧。","meaning_my":"တွေ့မယ့်နေရာကို ခင်ဗျားပဲ ရွေးလိုက်ပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S020_reply01","text":"好，我选好地方就发给你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ နေရာရွေးပြီးရင် ပို့ပေးမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S018_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S020_alt01","text":"见面的地点你定吧。","meaning_my":"တွေ့မယ့်နေရာကို ခင်ဗျားပဲ ရွေးလိုက်ပါ။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S018_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S018","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S021","text":"我找不到你。","meaning_my":"ခင်ဗျားကို ရှာမတွေ့ဘူး။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S021_reply01","text":"我就在A口旁边。","meaning_my":"A ထွက်ပေါက်နားမှာပဲ ရှိတယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S022_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S022","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S022","text":"你穿什么颜色的衣服？","meaning_my":"ဘာအရောင် အဝတ်အစား ဝတ်ထားလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S022_reply01","text":"我穿蓝色的。","meaning_my":"အပြာရောင် ဝတ်ထားတယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S023_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S023","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S023","text":"我穿黑色上衣。","meaning_my":"အပေါ်အင်္ကျီ အနက်ရောင် ဝတ်ထားတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S024","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S024","text":"正门还是侧门？","meaning_my":"အဓိကဝင်ပေါက်လား၊ ဘေးဝင်ပေါက်လား။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S025","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S025","text":"到了往里走一点。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ရင် အထဲကို နည်းနည်း ဝင်လာပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S025_reply01","text":"好，我往里走一点。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အထဲကို နည်းနည်း ဝင်လာမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S026_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S026","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S026","text":"我把详细地址发给你。","meaning_my":"လိပ်စာအပြည့်အစုံ ပို့ပေးမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S027","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.02-S027","text":"这里人太多，换个地方吧。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ လူများလွန်းလို့ တခြားနေရာ ပြောင်းကြရအောင်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.02-S027_reply01","text":"好，换到便利店门口吧。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ မီနီမတ်ဆိုင်ရှေ့ကို ပြောင်းကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S028_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.02-S027_alt01","text":"人太多了，咱们换个地方。","meaning_my":"လူများလွန်းလို့ တခြားနေရာ ပြောင်းကြရအောင်။","previous_id":"02.03.02-S028_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.02-S028","priority":"situational"}]},{"id":"02.03.03","title":"见面前确认","title_my":"မတွေ့ခင် ထပ်အတည်ပြုခြင်း","original_count":16,"added_count":10,"phrase_count":22,"phrases":[{"id":"02.03.03-S001","text":"明天还是三点吗？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန်လည်း သုံးနာရီပဲလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S001_reply01","text":"没变，还是三点。","meaning_my":"မပြောင်းဘူး၊ သုံးနာရီပဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S001_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S001","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S002","text":"明天照常吗？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် ပုံမှန်အတိုင်းပဲလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S002_reply01","text":"对，照常。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ အစီအစဉ်အတိုင်းပဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S008_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.03-S002_alt01","text":"明天按原计划来吗？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် မူလအစီအစဉ်အတိုင်းပဲလား။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S008_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“照常”表示仍按原计划进行，不是取消，也不是换时间。","text_my":"“照常” က မူလအစီအစဉ်အတိုင်း ဆက်လုပ်မယ်လို့ ဆိုလိုတယ်။ ဖျက်တာ၊ အချိန်ပြောင်းတာ မဟုတ်ဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.03-S008","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S003","text":"没变。","meaning_my":"မပြောင်းဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S009","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S004","text":"还是在原来的地方见吗？","meaning_my":"မူလနေရာမှာပဲ တွေ့ကြဦးမှာလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S004_reply01","text":"对，还是老地方。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ အရင်နေရာပဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S012_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.03-S004_alt01","text":"还在老地方见吧？","meaning_my":"အရင်နေရာမှာပဲ တွေ့ကြမှာလား။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S012_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S012","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S005","text":"你确定能来吗？","meaning_my":"သေချာ လာနိုင်မလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S005_reply01","text":"能，我一定到。","meaning_my":"လာနိုင်တယ်၊ သေချာ ရောက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S018_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.03-S005_alt01","text":"你能确定来吗？","meaning_my":"သေချာ လာနိုင်မလား။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S018_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S018","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S006","text":"我这边没问题。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်က အဆင်ပြေတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S019","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S007","text":"你准备几点出发？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်နှနာရီလောက် ထွက်ဖို့ စီစဉ်ထားလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S007_reply01","text":"三点左右出发。","meaning_my":"သုံးနာရီလောက် ထွက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S020_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S020","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S008","text":"我准备出发了。","meaning_my":"ထွက်ဖို့ ပြင်နေပြီ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S021","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S009","text":"我先过去占个位置。","meaning_my":"အရင်သွားပြီး နေရာယူထားမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S009_reply01","text":"好，我等会儿过去。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ခဏနေမှ လိုက်လာမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S022_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S022","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S010","text":"路上小心。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှာ သတိထားနော်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S010_reply01","text":"谢谢，你也小心。","meaning_my":"ကျေးဇူးပါ၊ ခင်ဗျားလည်း သတိထားနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S024_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S024","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S011","text":"临时有事，得改时间。","meaning_my":"ရုတ်တရက် ကိစ္စပေါ်လာလို့ အချိန် ပြောင်းရမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S011_reply01","text":"那我们改到明天吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို မနက်ဖြန် ပြောင်းကြရအောင်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S025_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S025","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.03-S012","text":"我再确认一下时间。","meaning_my":"အချိန်ကို ထပ်အတည်ပြုလိုက်ဦးမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S002","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S013","text":"我会准时到。","meaning_my":"အချိန်မှန် ရောက်မယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S013_reply01","text":"好，我也会准时到。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ကိုယ်လည်း အချိန်မှန် ရောက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S003_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S003","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S014","text":"有变化提前告诉我。","meaning_my":"အပြောင်းအလဲရှိရင် ကြိုပြောပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S014_reply01","text":"好，有变化我提前说。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အပြောင်းအလဲရှိရင် ကြိုပြောမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S004_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.03-S014_alt01","text":"如果有变动，提前说一声。","meaning_my":"အပြောင်းအလဲရှိရင် ကြိုပြောပေးနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S004_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S004","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S015","text":"需要我提前到吗？","meaning_my":"စောစော လာပေးရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S015_reply01","text":"不用，准时到就行。","meaning_my":"မလိုဘူး၊ အချိန်မှန် ရောက်ရင် ရပြီ။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S006_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S006","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S016","text":"你那边安排没变吧？","meaning_my":"အဲဒီဘက်က အစီအစဉ် မပြောင်းဘူးနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.03-S016_alt01","text":"你那边还是原计划吧？","meaning_my":"အဲဒီဘက်မှာ မူလအစီအစဉ်အတိုင်းပဲလား။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S007_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S007","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S017","text":"我出发的时候告诉你。","meaning_my":"ထွက်လာတဲ့အခါ ပြောမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S011","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S018","text":"地点换了。","meaning_my":"နေရာ ပြောင်းသွားပြီ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S018_reply01","text":"换到地铁站A口了。","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာ A ထွက်ပေါက်ကို ပြောင်းလိုက်ပြီ။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S013_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S013","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S019","text":"我可能会晚一点。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း နောက်ကျနိုင်တယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.03-S019_reply01","text":"没关系，路上小心。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ လမ်းမှာ သတိထားနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.03-S014_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S014","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S020","text":"出发前联系我。","meaning_my":"မထွက်ခင် ဆက်သွယ်ပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S015","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S021","text":"那我们周六见。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို စနေနေ့ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S016","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.03-S022","text":"怕堵车，可能会晚点。","meaning_my":"ကားပိတ်မှာ စိုးလို့ နည်းနည်း နောက်ကျနိုင်တယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.03-S023","priority":"situational"}]},{"id":"02.03.04","title":"到达碰面和接送","title_my":"ရောက်ရှိခြင်း၊ တွေ့ဆုံခြင်းနှင့် ကြိုပို့ခြင်း","original_count":20,"added_count":13,"phrase_count":30,"phrases":[{"id":"02.03.04-S001","text":"我到了。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ပြီ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S001_reply01","text":"好，我马上出来。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ချက်ချင်း ထွက်လာမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S001_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S001_alt01","text":"我已经到了。","meaning_my":"ရောက်နေပြီ။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S001_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S001","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S002","text":"你到了吗？","meaning_my":"ရောက်ပြီလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S002_reply01","text":"刚到，在门口。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ ရောက်တာ၊ တံခါးဝမှာ။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S021_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S021","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S003","text":"我刚到。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ ရောက်တာ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S003_alt01","text":"刚刚到。","meaning_my":"အခုလေးတင် ရောက်တာ။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S022_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S022","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S004","text":"我马上到。","meaning_my":"ရောက်တော့မယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S004_reply01","text":"好，我等你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ စောင့်နေမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S012_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S004_alt01","text":"快到了。","meaning_my":"ရောက်တော့မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S012_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S012","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S005","text":"我在门口等你。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S005_reply01","text":"好，我过来找你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ လာရှာမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S004_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S004","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S006","text":"你出来一下。","meaning_my":"အပြင်ကို ခဏထွက်လာပါဦး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S005","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S007","text":"你到门口给我打电话。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝရောက်ရင် ဖုန်းဆက်ပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S007","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S008","text":"你能看到我吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ရှိနေတာ မြင်ရလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S008_reply01","text":"看到了，就在前面。","meaning_my":"မြင်ပြီ၊ ရှေ့နားမှာပဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S008_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S008_alt01","text":"你看得见我吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ရှိနေတာ မြင်ရလား။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S008_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S008","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S009","text":"我看到你了。","meaning_my":"မြင်ပြီ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S009_alt01","text":"我看见你了。","meaning_my":"မြင်ပြီ။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S017_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S017","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S010","text":"我马上出来。","meaning_my":"အခုထွက်လာတော့မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S020","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S011","text":"我没看到你。","meaning_my":"ခင်ဗျားကို မမြင်ရသေးဘူး။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S011_reply01","text":"我穿黑色上衣，就在A口。","meaning_my":"အပေါ်အင်္ကျီ အနက်ရောင် ဝတ်ထားတယ်၊ A ထွက်ပေါက်နားမှာ။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S023_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S023","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.03.04-S012","text":"我来接你。","meaning_my":"လာကြိုပေးမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S012_reply01","text":"好，我在A口等你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ A ထွက်ပေါက်မှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S002_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S012_alt01","text":"我过去接你。","meaning_my":"လာကြိုပေးမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S002_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“接你”是去迎接、接人；“送你回去”是把对方送走或送回原处。","text_my":"“接你” က လာကြိုတာပါ။ “送你回去” က တစ်ဖက်လူကို ပြန်လိုက်ပို့တာ။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.04-S002","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S013","text":"不用接，我自己过去。","meaning_my":"လာကြိုစရာ မလိုဘူး၊ ကိုယ်တိုင် သွားလိုက်မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S013_alt01","text":"我自己来就行，不用接。","meaning_my":"ကိုယ်တိုင် လာလို့ရတယ်၊ လာကြိုစရာမလိုဘူး။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S003_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S003","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S014","text":"你在站里还是站外？","meaning_my":"ဘူတာအထဲမှာလား၊ အပြင်မှာလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S014_reply01","text":"在站外，A口旁边。","meaning_my":"ဘူတာအပြင် A ထွက်ပေါက်နားမှာ။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S006_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S006","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S015","text":"我把位置发给你。","meaning_my":"တည်နေရာ ပို့ပေးမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S009","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S016","text":"我在车里等你。","meaning_my":"ကားထဲမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S010","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S017","text":"我在一楼大厅等你。","meaning_my":"မြေညီထပ် ဧည့်ခန်းမမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"culture","text":"中国大陆常把地面层叫“一楼”；缅甸部分建筑按Ground Floor另算，找人以楼层指示牌为准。","text_my":"တရုတ်ပြည်မကြီးမှာ မြေညီထပ်ကို “一楼” လို့ ခေါ်တတ်တယ်။ မြန်မာမှာ Ground Floor ကို သီးသန့်ခေါ်တာရှိလို့ အထပ်ဆိုင်းဘုတ်ကို ကြည့်ပါ။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.04-S011","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S018","text":"我还在地铁站里。","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာထဲမှာပဲ ရှိသေးတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S013","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S019","text":"你先找个地方坐一下。","meaning_my":"အရင် ထိုင်စောင့်နေပါဦး။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S019_reply01","text":"好，我找个位置坐着等。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ထိုင်စောင့်ဖို့ နေရာရှာလိုက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S014_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S014","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S020","text":"你不用特意跑一趟。","meaning_my":"တကူးတက လာစရာ မလိုဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S015","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S021","text":"我自己回去。","meaning_my":"ကိုယ်တိုင် ပြန်လိုက်မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S021_alt01","text":"我自己回就好。","meaning_my":"ကိုယ်တိုင် ပြန်လိုက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S016_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S016","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S022","text":"你往前走一点。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့ကို နည်းနည်း လျှောက်လာပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S022_reply01","text":"好，我往前走一点。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ရှေ့ကို နည်းနည်း ဆက်လျှောက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S018_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S018","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S023","text":"我在路边等你。","meaning_my":"လမ်းဘေးမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S019","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S024","text":"我在你后面。","meaning_my":"ခင်ဗျား နောက်မှာ ရှိတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S024_alt01","text":"我就在你身后。","meaning_my":"ခင်ဗျား နောက်တည့်တည့်မှာ ရှိတယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S024_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S024","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S025","text":"你从哪个出口出来？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ထွက်ပေါက်က ထွက်လာတာလဲ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S025_alt01","text":"你是从哪个口出来的？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ထွက်ပေါက်က ထွက်လာတာလဲ။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S025_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S025","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S026","text":"我在停车场。","meaning_my":"ကားပါကင်မှာ ရှိတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S026_reply01","text":"好，我去停车场找你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ကားပါကင်ကို လာရှာမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S026_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S026","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S027","text":"上车吧。","meaning_my":"ကားပေါ် တက်လိုက်ပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S027_reply01","text":"好，走吧。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ သွားကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S029_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S029","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S028","text":"我送你回去。","meaning_my":"ပြန်လိုက်ပို့ပေးမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S028_reply01","text":"不用，太麻烦你了。","meaning_my":"မလိုပါဘူး၊ အားနာပါတယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S030_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“送你回去”只说送回去，不一定是送回家；如果明确“送你回家”才是回家。","text_my":"“送你回去” က ပြန်လိုက်ပို့တာပါ။ အိမ်ကိုပဲ ပို့တယ်လို့ မဆိုလိုဘူး။ “送你回家” ဆိုမှ အိမ်ပြန်ပို့တာ။"}],"previous_id":"02.03.04-S030","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S029","text":"不用送，我打车回去。","meaning_my":"လိုက်ပို့စရာ မလိုဘူး၊ တက္ကစီစီးပြီး ပြန်မယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S029_reply01","text":"好，回去小心。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ပြန်ရင် သတိထားနော်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S031_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S029_alt01","text":"不用送，我自己坐出租车回去。","meaning_my":"လိုက်ပို့စရာ မလိုဘူး၊ တက္ကစီစီးပြီး ပြန်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S031_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S031","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.03.04-S030","text":"你先吃，不用等我。","meaning_my":"အရင်စားနှင့်ပါ၊ စောင့်စရာ မလိုဘူး။","replies":[{"id":"02.03.04-S030_reply01","text":"好，我先吃了。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အရင်စားလိုက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S033_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.03.04-S030_alt01","text":"你先吃吧，别等我。","meaning_my":"အရင်စားနှင့်ပါ၊ စောင့်စရာ မလိုဘူး။","previous_id":"02.03.04-S033_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.03.04-S033","priority":"situational"}]}],"extras_summary":{"main":113,"replies":60,"alternatives":37,"notes":10,"total_audio":210},"quality_review":{"date":"2026-11-11","status":"draft_pending_native_review","ids_reindexed":true,"before":124,"after":113,"removed":11}}
